[ti:The Internationale]
[00:05.84]Arise, you prisoners of starvation,
[00:12.27]Arise, you damned throughout the Earth!
[00:16.71]For reason thunders condemnation
[00:21.30]And there's a better world in birth!
[00:25.67]It is time to seize our liberation,
[00:30.41]Arise, arise, you slaves in thrall!
[00:35.01]The Earth will change at its foundation,
[00:39.49]We who are nothing shall be all!
[00:43.87]This is our grand finale,
[00:48.60]Stand as one, each in place.
[00:52.73]The Internationale unites the human race.
[01:02.07]This is our grand finale,
[01:06.92]Stand as one, each in place!
[01:11.49]The Internationale unites the human race.
[01:21.09]We want no condescending saviours,
[01:25.81]No god, no king, no lord to heed.
[01:30.19]The workers ask not for their favours;
[01:34.78]For we will save ourseleves from need!
[01:39.03]We will make the thief disgorge his plunder ,
[01:43.73]And free the shackled from their lot.
[01:48.04]The fires in our furnace thunder,
[01:52.51]We'll strike the iron while it's hot!
[01:57.06]This is our grand finale,
[02:01.62]Stand as one, each in place.
[02:06.08]The Internationale unites the human race.
[02:15.43]This is our grand finale,
[02:20.43]Stand as one, each in place!
[02:24.84]The Internationale unites the human race!
[02:33.88]The system cheats in every nation,
[02:38.57]While laws and taxes drain our life.
[02:43.03]The rich are free from obligation;
[02:47.77]But for the poor is endless strife.
[02:52.04]We have languished while they lounge in beauty,
[02:56.56]The law of equals rightly cites:
[03:01.10]"No rights to those refusing duty,
[03:05.36]No claims of duty without rights!"
[03:10.09]This is our grand finale,
[03:14.82]Stand as one, each in place.
[03:19.27]The Internationale unites the human race.
[03:28.59]This is our grand finale,
[03:33.25]Stand as one, each in place!
[03:37.86]The Internationale unites the human race!
[03:47.09]All hideous in brutal glory,
[03:51.65]The kings of mine and rail and soil!
[03:56.41]But have you read in all their story,
[04:00.72]On how they plundered workers' toil?
[04:05.39]We will fight for the redistribution
[04:09.79]Of workers' labour, thieved by few.
[04:14.24]In working for their restitution,
[04:18.95]The people only take their due.
[04:23.41]This is our grand finale,
[04:27.92]Stand as one, each in place.
[04:32.36]The Internationale unites the human race.
[04:41.61]This is our grand finale,
[04:46.39]Stand as one, each in place!
[04:50.98]The Internationale unites the human race.
[05:00.09]We see through their disinformation:
[05:04.84]Attempts to lead us into war.
[05:09.46]But now the soldiers in formation
[05:13.89]Will break their ranks and fight no more.
[05:18.45]If the gruesome cannibals keep trying
[05:22.84]To sacrifice us to their pride,
[05:27.39]They soon shall hear the bullets flying,
[05:31.88]We'll shoot the generals on our side!
[05:36.44]This is our grand finale,
[05:40.92]Stand as one, each in place.
[05:45.42]The Internationale unites the human race.
[05:54.76]This is our grand finale,
[05:59.58]Stand as one, each in place!
[06:03.93]The Internationale unites the human race.
[06:13.23]Just we, the workers of the world-wide,
[06:18.28]The mighty party of labour,
[06:22.82]To own the planet have a true right,
[06:27.44]But for the parasites一never!
[06:31.85]For too long we've endured exploitation,
[06:36.42]Too long we've been the vulture's prey.
[06:40.90]Farewell to days of condemnation!
[06:45.45]The red dawn brings a bright new day!
[06:49.89]This is our grand finale,
[06:54.88]Stand as one, each in place.
[06:59.20]The Internationale unites the human race.
[07:08.46]This is our grand finale,
[07:13.48]Stand as one, each in place!
[07:18.07]The Internationale unites the human race!
